## versions
cargo-llvm-cov 0.9.2
cargo 1.100.0 (3acc79c0c 2026-11-05)
rustc 1.100.0 (0ef1bc386 2026-11-09)

## A. baseline: one function of two is covered, the gate is 100% of lines
$ cargo llvm-cov --workspace --locked --fail-under-lines 100
    TOTAL: lines 9, missed 3, cover 66.67%
    -> exit 1

